  "body": "Designed to embrace modern coastal living, this thoughtfully planned two-level residence brings together generous space, practical design, and everyday comfort. Positioned on an approximately 757sqm section, with a proposed 242sqm (approx.) floor area, the home is designed to feature four bedrooms, two bathrooms, spacious open-plan living, an expansive outdoor deck, and a double internal-access garage. With Signature Homes building guarantees included, it offers an exciting opportunity to enjoy a new coastal home with added peace of mind.\r\nProperty Highlights:\r\nThe spacious open-plan kitchen, dining, and living area forms the heart of the ground floor, with raked ceilings designed to enhance the sense of height and openness.\r\nThe kitchen features a generous walk-in pantry, providing excellent storage and keeping the main kitchen organised and functional for everyday living.\r\nThe open-plan living spaces are designed to extend onto an expansive outdoor deck, creating a seamless indoor-outdoor environment for family gatherings, weekend barbecues, and relaxed coastal living.\r\nThree well-proportioned bedrooms are conveniently positioned on the ground floor, with one offering direct access to the outdoor deck. They are serviced by a well-designed family bathroom arrangement, with a separate toilet room and a dedicated bathroom featuring both a shower and bathtub.\r\nPrivately positioned on the upper level, the generous master suite is designed to capture beautiful ocean views. It features its own ensuite and a dedicated walk-in wardrobe, creating a peaceful retreat away from the main family living spaces.\r\nA separate laundry room provides a dedicated space for everyday household tasks, adding further practicality to the home's layout.\r\nDucted air conditioning on the ground floor and a heat pump in the master ensuite are included in the proposed design to enhance year-round comfort.\r\nA double internal-access garage provides secure parking and convenient access to the home, while two additional outdoor parking spaces offer flexibility for family members and visiting guests.\r\nPerfectly positioned within the prestigious Hobbs Bay Estate on the Whangaparaoa Peninsula, the property offers an exceptional coastal lifestyle with direct beach access, scenic walking trails, communal green spaces, and a children's playground. The shoreline is just a short stroll away, while Gulf Harbour School, Wentworth Primary, and local amenities are within easy reach. The future Penlink connection is also expected to further improve accessibility to the wider Auckland region.\r\nContact us today to find out more about this exceptional coastal home opportunity.",
